This subject covers the study of the origin and development of civiliz ation during the
five historical periods—prehistoric, ancient, middle age, modern, and the present period. The
study will focus on significant social, economic and political events resulting from values and
attitudes due to customs, beliefs and innovation s, including the ability to communicate
through art and literature based on several perspectives and periods.
