1. Read with a large degree of independence, adapting style and speed of reading to

different texts and purposes.

2. Translate the text read from English into Thai, using appropriate language in relation to

the purpose of the text translated including idioms, expressions, proverbs and sayings.

3. Acquire a broad active reading vocabulary, and can choose appropriate meanings when

translating from Thai into English.

4. Quickly identify the content and relevance of news items, articles and reports on a

wide range of professional topics for their translation work.

