The course emphasizes English language learning and development through using it
for communication in authentic situations through outside class activities or internship
experience. Evidences of learning and/or learning reflections from the experience are required.
Learning Outcomes

1. Ability to use English in authentic contexts.

2. Understanding of learning experiences.

3. Having responsibility and conform to ethical standards.

