This course aims to broaden students’ knowledge about business communication and
to train students in basic communication skills in English to prepare them for their future
careers.

Business trends and topics, namely business organization, management, sales and
marketing, finance and international trade, are included in the course content. The course
also focuses on practical application of functional language in business contexts e.g. giving
presentations, negotiating, providing customer service, telephoning, contributing to meetings
and dealing with job interview questions. Learning Outcomes

98
