1. Develop critical thinking skills through readings.

2. Identify the lines of logic and argument of the issues presented in the texts.

3. Identify and evaluate facts and opinions of the reading texts.

4. Recognise and analyse strategies and styles the author uses in different types of texts.

5. Evaluate the texts by identifying their strengths and weaknesses.

6. Have responsibility and ethical awareness.

